<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@/~cl_15> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@/~cl_15> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 30a of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) Any person who fails or refuses to comply with the order made under subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not less than twenty-five thousand ringgit and not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both.”. Amendment of section 31"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@> .
