<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@/~cl_30__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any obligation, liability, disqualification, penalty or punishment accrued or incurred under the principal Act, may be continued, enforced, imposed and be dealt with, as the case may be, as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@> .
