<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 16 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Any holder of a licence who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not less than twenty-five thousand ringgit and not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both, and shall also be liable to a further fine of one thousand ringgit for every day during which the offence continues after a notice by the Director General requiring him to comply with such term or condition specified therein has been served on him.”. Amendment of section 18"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/35/eng@> .
